{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方三行大号引文首先入眼，薄荷绿色的“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”“沉默也很舒服”最醒目；随后下方另一块大号灰白引文也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"模糊抓到两个人正处于亲近、安静相处的状态；他似乎想停留在当下，具体的心理处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、安静、亲近；是否同时有疏远、犹豫的情绪，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实想表达自己有多喜欢，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，但没想好怎么开口，念头逐渐淡去。舒服与心绪漂远之间的反差，以及这种反差和未说出口的话之间的关系，第一眼不容易抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号引文都比较显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"上方单块引文较长，包含亲近、舒适、沉默、心绪漂远等多个层次。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块引文里，需要拼接才能理解他既享受亲近又有未表达的心意。\",\n    \"中间一块较小的青绿色文字连续铺陈，需要额外阅读才能补足情绪变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f95c47f4-c5bf-478d-bc38-7fcf058dd2ea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010857201627Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:09:42.611842+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1dc5a7e80148800fdbb0f0417a72f42146077e7b6569ed9b5b9f28fce07be84", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g